This product includes software developed by Yayasan Pesantren Cipansor and
contributors (https://github.com/cipansor/crateworks).

The statistical distributions, regression and hypothesis tests reproduce the
results of formulajs by Sutoiku, Inc. and contributors
(https://github.com/formulajs/formulajs) and the jStat library by Trevor Norris
and contributors (https://github.com/jstat/jstat), both distributed under the
MIT licence. The kernels were written from those projects' published algorithms
and share no code with them; the cases in `tests/oracle.rs` were produced by
running formulajs.

`CONVERT`'s unit table is extracted from formulajs's own `CONVERT` function by
`research/tools/gen_convert_units.py`, which reads the installed package rather
than a retyped copy. The conversion arithmetic is this crate's own.

